{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5d17fc685dd8ad3b20a861df082bd6a9ef8a436475fcb2d16e96c3ad830cf49b", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。琴葉とバレンタインの催事場に\n行ってきた。休憩をしようとカフェに入ったが……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。和琴叶一起去了情人节活动会场。\n本想进咖啡店休息一下，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "75351e1aa85215a4e8d13c459d39b62c16274005ee0cebf187129bec16fe10d7", "ja": "はあ……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0e932929c7a0512a8c3c6b8b46471fa50aa60331bfc4e524e180c3970df4217d", "ja": "琴葉、どうかしたか？\nなんだか、ボーッとしているみたいだけど。", "zh": "琴叶，怎么了？\n感觉你有点心不在焉的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "d50641251e401675618b27679184e09f1407ef9907b982b5acbc5460bd370a70", "ja": "えっ？　あ……いえ！　何でもありません！\nさっきのことを思い出しちゃっただけで……。", "zh": "咦？啊……没什么！只是想起了刚才的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c5c87bc7d5d213d409fd2cda88bcc7c02ad0a350fd05262594c0d281e47c2140", "ja": "さっきのこと……？", "zh": "刚才的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "969a3d26d73d907118453d31187413f3fd0eabb15d1b83e36e88196ce7d44068", "ja": "はい。イベントで記念撮影をしてもらった時、\nカメラマンさんやスタッフさんに、そ、その……。", "zh": "是的。活动上请摄影师和工作人员帮忙拍纪念照时，他们、他们那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "d21ac21aef31374f0dd1307af255f3fe97c994308ed40edb89f09419f1c26f89", "ja": "私たちのこと……カップルだと思われてしまって……。\n説明しようと思ったんですけど、並んでる人もいて。", "zh": "他们以为我们……是情侣……。\n我本来想解释的，但是排队的人也很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1007_p", "source_sha256": "23cf02beb315a3d6e7f2aca21a1f9c62626554d3ff22727946e0d1cceb87646f", "ja": "ああ。誤解をとく時間すらなかったな……。\n嫌な気持ちにさせちゃったよな。すまなかった。", "zh": "啊，连澄清误会的时间都没有……  \n让你感到不舒服了吧。对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "ff1a9b3322f546644b2302b5c4dd2c9d2b88c2242635ac785cce541030ee7d5d", "ja": "ち、違います！　嫌だったわけじゃなくて！\nむしろ、嬉しかった……な、なんてっ！", "zh": "不、不是那样！我不是讨厌……！\n恰恰相反，我其实很开心……我、我在说什么呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "3a352e53790773110e8559f7fb52beab360674e2571bfd7a77349acbd5bedb79", "ja": "あはは、今のは気にしないでください。それより、\nいいんですか？　記念写真、私がもらっちゃって。", "zh": "啊哈哈，刚才那段请别在意。话说回来，真的可以吗？这张纪念照就让我收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1010_p", "source_sha256": "307c2e01f02bae66dcde5d6ed2ba1096eae0583ce08c223703a05554cd21e528", "ja": "もちろん。\n写真が欲しいって顔に書いてあったからな。", "zh": "当然了。\n因为你脸上就写着想要照片嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "c1ce9ce542c131d6652e5c109039518588cfe988271be6f33084a282a52774aa", "ja": "えっ！？　私、顔に出ちゃってましたか？\nううっ……。", "zh": "诶！？我把想要照片的心情写在脸上了吗？\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "ff9fed4d34c8e3147dd0bccd717bd350ec7fd078e05c6723e32e67230a6fa633", "ja": "ふふっ。ありがとうございます。\n写真と……あと素敵なフォトフレームも。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您。\n照片……还有漂亮的相框也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "6de5dc339ea2791e42d9c2ef101424a54074c992abd6f47d8d1fe110196c885a", "ja": "{$P$}との特別な思い出が\nできたみたいで……嬉しいです。", "zh": "能和{$P$}拥有\n这份特别的回忆……我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e4f9cd75cbd6a35f15b9f33500f9f0c1748a6b16df57690d3c305a9024756a32", "ja": "琴葉が喜んでくれてよかった。\nかなり特別だったからな。", "zh": "琴叶能感到开心，真是太好了。\n毕竟这次相当特别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "1ada42812f15acfbbe0a152b983ef43c689b84b534d340af4b0aa48e6dfa286c", "ja": "え、{$P$}もですか？\nかなり特別って……それって、えっと……。", "zh": "咦，{$P$}也是吗？\n你说的特别……那个，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a0f545cace3dce4fbfe8b0387997bd9a3bc4de83bcff7e432c38981e8d5ff51d", "ja": "そのフォトフレーム、バレンタインの限定品だからな！\n今しか買えない特別品だ！", "zh": "那个相框可是情人节限定商品！\n是只有现在才能买到的特别商品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "9440a1974445e1132fb903ddceaf7c603ea82ff66c8babd5061b4bed0ad54623", "ja": "……えっ？　フォトフレーム……？\nな、なんだ……。", "zh": "……诶？相框……？\n没、没什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3ba295e596ae9442464fc53931ba10bbe4dcd6e7569ba015898413231007dd18", "ja": "ん？　どうした、琴葉？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "b7ea59e9da6fc017ee0b8e880d86e63f9a6d386360c3d7921d30928c22f1cec9", "ja": "あ、はい！　き、奇遇ですね！　私も、\n特別なフォトフレームで嬉しいなって思ってました！", "zh": "啊，好的！真、真巧啊！我也正想着，有这么特别的相框真开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0364_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "59876bd24de30a115a4c5ca96fc39eea237ed72530f110c13dfd648ffb326afd", "ja": "そうじゃなくても、{$P$}との\n大事な思い出ですから。ずっと、大切にしますね。", "zh": "即使不是那样，这也是和{$P$}一起度过的重要回忆。所以，我会一直珍惜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
